// CRT chain for color vectors with beam overdrive (Star Wars etc.). Same pipeline as the Color HDR
// chain; intensity_overdrive drives the white-hot overload bloom in the post-mask glow buffer.
//   Bloom uses 8 levels at 0.5x (bloom_lvl0..7 = window/2..window/256 generated by vector_downsample),
//   ladder-accumulated into the window-proportional acc0..acc6 pyramid (RGBA16F) with 9-tap tent upsample.
{
	"name": "Vector (Overload, HDR)",
	"author": "Ryan Holtz & ImJezze (original HLSL) / okaz (vector adaptation)",
	"screen_type": "vector",

